# Without the mark the sketch is read as built; `run` writes the report to the built `Sink`, which logs it.

route archive.run
step run/Sink()
step run/Sink.write

line entry > run call
line run/Sink() > Sink@run/Sink() value
line Sink@run/Sink() > run/Sink.write value
line run/Sink.write > Screen own

home Sink@run/Sink() run

side entry left
side Screen right

# building the exported Sink runs its public methods, so `new Sink()` reaches what write logs
